{"tool_name":"nd-safir","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>ND-SAFIR is a software for denoising n-dimentionnal images especially dedicated to microscopy image sequence analysis. It is able to deal with 2D, 3D, 2D+time, 3D+time images have one or more color channel. It is adapted to Gaussian and Poisson-Gaussian noise which are usually encountered in photonic imaging. Several papers describe the detail of the method used in ndsafir to recover noise free images (see references).</p>\n\n<p>It is available either in Metamorph (commercial version), either as command line tool. Source are available on demand.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>ND-SAFIR is a software for denoising n-dimentionnal images especially dedicated to microscopy image sequence analysis. It is able to deal with 2D, 3D, 2D+time, 3D+time images have one or more color channel. It is adapted to Gaussian and Poisson-Gaussian noise which are usually encountered in photonic imaging. Several papers describe the detail of the method used in ndsafir to recover noise free images (see references).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It is available either in Metamorph (commercial version), either as command line tool. Source are available on demand.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-10-19T14:47:30+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-05-03T15:34:53+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":"","last_comment_timestamp":1588520425,"last_comment_uid":1,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Boulanger J\u00e9r\u00f4me"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":1,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"ff7211b9-a937-4c33-aac3-22aa10053480","url":"/user/1"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4147,"target_type":"taxonomy